                                "sense_id": "83cbb3fc-ba88-34fd-8a89-863bfb8eb9bf",
                                "text": "It is now believed that many species of sharks come inshore at night to feed and, therefore, that attacks made during the day are not related to the feeding process."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
